{"id":"e28d5f73ab0dc209","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-np-search-to-decision.md","title":"Search from Decision Under P = NP","display":"thm-np-search-to-decision — Search from Decision Under P = NP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-np-search-to-decision","aliases":["28-thm-np-search-to-decision"],"display":"thm-np-search-to-decision — Search from Decision Under P = NP","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-np-search-to-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-np-search-to-decision</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-np-search-to-decision — Search from Decision Under P = NP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"77951782409bcade\" href=\"?note=77951782409bcade\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier\">28-df-polynomial-time-verifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(v\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(n)=c(n+2)^a\">\\(p(n)=c(n+2)^a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a> 的单射配对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1\\rangle\">\\(\\langle1\\rangle\\)</span> 为单字符字串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 采用所列本地定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\le p(|x|)}\\;v(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,w))=\\langle1\\rangle)\">\\(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\le p(|x|)}\\;v(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,w))=\\langle1\\rangle)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\n\\left(|f(x)|\\le p(|x|)\\land v(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,f(x)))=\\langle1\\rangle\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\n\\left(|f(x)|\\le p(|x|)\\land v(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,f(x)))=\\langle1\\rangle\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先把证据补成带长度字段的固定多项式长编码。询问“存在以当前前缀开头的接受证据”是 NP 判定问题；在 P=NP 下逐位选择仍可延拓为证据的一支，至多多项式次询问得到证据。先判定不存在证据时输出空串，可使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 对所有输入全定义。原书先展示 SAT 的逐变量自归约，再经保留证据的 Cook–Levin 归约推广到一般验证器。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.18及证明；印刷55页；PDF81页。原书SAT自归约及一般验证器推广已核对。\n文件名修订：本条结论量化任意多项式时间验证关系，并不限于 SAT，因此由 sat-search-to-decision 更名为 np-search-to-decision；有界长度证书的数学结论保持不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-verifier","status":"resolved","id":"77951782409bcade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-verifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$，$v\\in\\mathbf{FP}$，$a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$p(n)=c(n+2)^a$；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 采用 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]] 的单射配对，$\\langle1\\rangle$ 为单字符字串；$\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{FP}$ 采用所列本地定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"p(n)=c(n+2)^a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\le p(|x|)}\\;v(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,w))=\\langle1\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\n\\left(|f(x)|\\le p(|x|)\\land v(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,f(x)))=\\langle1\\rangle\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1864,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"归约、搜索与层级扩充：[[28-thm-np-hardness-consequences]]、[[28-thm-exp-nexp-padding]]、[[28-thm-np-search-to-decision]]、[[28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["dd9febae42d44280","0cb5248561455df8","adb92775ec020a0b","77951782409bcade","0dfeff4bd5d69b86"]}